  "decision_conditions": [
    "For clarity, this application only discharges parts (a), (b) and (d) of Condition 5. Part (c) remains outstanding, as the submitted surveys have confirmed the presence of a soprano pipistrelle day roost within Building 1. In accordance with the condition, a valid European Protected Species Mitigation Licence (EPSML) issued by Natural England, together with details of the approved mitigation, must be submitted to the Local Planning Authority for approval in order to fully discharge the condition. No works affecting the roost may lawfully proceed until the licence has been obtained and approved."
